thatteOS is a balanced ternary microkernel operating system
written in ManiT, targeting photonic-ternary hardware
(The THATTE Device). It provides trit-addressed virtual memory,
consensus scheduling, TritFS filesystem, and trit-stream IPC.

Patent applications covering the underlying hardware have been
filed with the Indian Patent Office (Application Nos.
202621045270–202621045342, filed 9 April 2026).
